        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John R. Fischetti\n- Organizations: New York Herald Tribune, Chicago Daily News, National Cartoonists Society\n- Awards: Pulitzer Prize for Editorial Cartooning\n- Concepts: cartoon\n\nFacts:\n- John R. Fischetti was born on September 27, 1916, and died on November 18, 1980.\n- John R. Fischetti was an editorial cartoonist for the New York Herald Tribune and the Chicago Daily News.\n- John R. Fischetti received the Pulitzer Prize for Editorial Cartooning in 1969.\n- John R. Fischetti received numerous awards from the National Cartoonists Society.\n- A cartoon is a type of two-dimensional illustration that may be animated.",
